  m_Text: 'controls


    move: WASD

    sprint: hold left shift

    jump: space

    eat:
    hold C

    drink: hold V

    switch character: tab


    aim: hold right mouse

    aim
    right shoulder: E

    aim left shoulder: Q

    fire / take photo: left mouse

    reload:
    R

    camera zoom: mouse scroll


    map: left ctrl


    interact / enter
    kettengrad: F

    campfire / kettengrad headlight: G

    exit kettengrad: hold
    F


    wait command: X


    menu: esc



'
